      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come out and laugh, sing and cry along to Pillow Fite (w/ full band) Friday, April 19th, as the duo releases their new single, Alma, at the Seahorse Tavern.&nbsp;Joining the band will be Halifax's favourite Twitch troubadour, Alanna Matty, and electro-pop powerhouse, Izra Fitch."
      }
